170MHz  ok.

[chip] SYSCLK is 170 MHz, but above 150 MHz the G431 needs range 1 boost mode (PWR_CR5.R1MODE = 0). Out of spec; real chips may misbehave.
hclk @ . 170000000  ok.
init-Systimer  ok.
millis 250 delay-ms millis swap - . 250  ok.
